# Secrets for this flow. Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# .env is loaded automatically when the flow runs; read a value in flow.md as ${env.NAME}.
# Never commit .env (it is listed in .gitignore) and never put secrets in config/config.json.
#
# Examples:
# GMAIL_USER=you@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-app-password
# API_TOKEN=
